From 7a63798015a78bb7ed18a59a9d94a85a91a28485 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 14sea <wanhuaning@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 20 May 2026 20:03:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gitignore: orchestrator state marker + __pycache__ + auto-POF

These are reproducible build/orchestrator artifacts, not source:
  .rot_tpu_handoff_applied  - rot_tpu_handoff make apply/unapply marker
  __pycache__/              - Python compile cache (host/*.py)
  quartus/*.pof             - auto-emitted next to .sof on every Quartus build

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitignore | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index f262f76..3304ca4 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -46,3 +46,13 @@ sim/tb_*[!.v]
 *.swp
 *~
 tools/
+
+# Orchestrator state marker (rot_tpu_handoff make apply/unapply flow)
+.rot_tpu_handoff_applied
+
+# Python caches
+__pycache__/
+*.pyc
+
+# Quartus auto-generated POF (auto-emitted next to .sof; reproducible)
+quartus/*.pof
-- 
2.43.0

